        <mxCell id="source-scope-note" value="DESIGN_PENDING_RUNTIME. Customer checkout detail and dashboard counters do not implement this operational unpaid-booking list. Read source/port lifeline groups the named query dependencies; it is not an invented runtime repository class. A read-only snapshot transaction, when used in source, does not imply a domain mutation, replay result store, ledger entry or money transfer. Sources: backend/src/services/booking-proposals/booking-checkout.service.js; backend/src/services/providers/payos/mongo-payment-webhook.repository.js." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
